{
  "$description": "Hippocampus design tokens. Dark theme only for v1. Surfaces, borders and text use a neutral dark theme; accent, think, confirm, danger, focus ring and radii come from the app's own dark tokens. Semantic colors are checked for contrast on bg-0 and bg-1.",
